<p>Hi {{{Recovery__c.Contact_First_Name__c}}},</p>

<p>We wanted to let you know your access link to our secure portal has expired.</p>

<p>To provide your bank details regarding your Qantas reimbursement, please reply to this email with a preferred time for us to call you back to assist you.</p>

<h3>Need help?</h3>

<p>Call us on 13 13 13 (in Australia) or your local Qantas Office <a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/support/contact-us.html">here</a> for assistance. Have your Customer care reference number {{{Recovery__c.Parent_Case__c}}} ready to enter.</p>
